dsl metta

Concept Widget

	Concept Status
		sub Visible
		sub Invisible
		sub Readonly

		Concept:{0..1} When
			def string[] status

		Concept:{0..1} IfEquals
			def string tag
			def string value
			
	sub Header
		def string label

	sub Region
		def integer:{%} width = -1%
		has Widget

	sub Split
		has Widget

	sub Stack
		def string children
		def integer max = empty
		has Widget

	sub Picture
		def string subjectType
		def string defaultImage = empty
		has:{0..1} Size

	sub Field
		def string tag
		def string label = empty
		!! By assigning an alias, input value is stored in view context allowing other inputs to use its value
		def string alias = empty

		facet Positioning

			sub Relative
				def integer width = -1%
				def word:{_0px _5px _10px _15px _20px} spacing = _10px

			sub Absolute
				def integer width = -1px
				def word:{_0px _5px _10px _15px _20px} spacing = _10px

		facet Multiple // Only for Text and Link
			def word:{Vertical Horizontal} arrangement = Vertical
			Concept:{0..1} Boundary > def integer min; def integer max
			Concept:{0..1} Mode > def integer min; def integer max

		facet FieldType

			sub Text
				def word:{None Uppercase Lowercase Sentence Title} mode = None
				def word:{Header1 Header2 Header3 Header4 Header5 Body1 Body2} appearance = empty
				def string[] options = empty

				Concept:Single Pattern
					facet Email
					facet RegularExpression
						def string value
						Concept Meta > def integer position; def string indicator

				Concept:Single Highlighted
					def string textColor = "white"
					def string backgroundColor = "black"

			sub Memo
				def integer:{rows} height
				def word:{None Rich} mode = None

			sub Link
				def word:{This All Root Parent GrandParent} scope = This
				def string subjectType = empty
				!! Triple expression. For example: * country Spain
				def string filter = empty
				def View.Reference reference
				def View.Projection navigate = empty
				def string value
				
			sub WebLink
				def boolean openNewTab = true

			sub Check

			sub Checklist
				def word:{This All Root Parent GrandParent} scope = This
				def string subjectType = empty
				def string filter = empty
				def string reference

			sub Date
				def word:{Seconds Minutes Hours Days Months Years} resolution
				def word:{None Past Future} scope = None // empty -> poder indicar empty para quitar el None
			
			sub Number
				def integer decimalsCount = 0
				def word:{Number Currency Bytes Percentage Exponential} format = Number
				def word:{Input Button Slider} mode = Input

				has:{0..1} Range				
			
			sub Location

				Concept:{0..1} Zoom
					def integer defaultZoom = 15
					def integer min = 1
					def integer max = 18
				
				Concept:{0..1} Center
					def double latitude
					def double longitude

			sub Sequence
				def string format
				def string name

Concept Size as component
	def integer:{px} width
	def integer:{px} height				

Concept Range as component
	def integer min
	def integer max
